title: The pencil draws over the canvas in a colour and a width, rubs out a part of it, and clears it all
folders: rust-small
expect-log: script: Tool\("move"\)

wait 3500
ui click 505 864
wait 500
mark pencil-on
wait 500
drag 700 300 1100 300
drag 1100 300 1100 600
ui click 477 820
ui click 600 820
wait 300
drag 700 650 1200 700
wait 400
mark drawn
wait 500
zoom 0.6
wait 900
mark zoomed-out
wait 500
zoom 1.6667
wait 900
ui click 640 820
wait 300
drag 880 250 920 350
drag 1050 500 1150 500
wait 400
mark rubbed
wait 500
ui click 670 820
wait 400
mark cleared
wait 500
tool move
wait 400
mark hand-again
wait 500
quit
